# NTL .gitignore — gitallow-pattern style (allowlist within constrained
# subtrees). Per CLAUDE.md "use a gitallow pattern for .gitignore".
#
# User-approved entries (feature 002 implementation, 2026-05-16):
#   - src/meson/tune-tables/host-tuned.ini (Wizard auto-tune output;
#     not committed by default, user MAY commit explicitly for fork
#     reproducibility per FR-005c)
#   - *.egg-info/ (Python pip build artifacts from
#     `pip install ./tools`)
#
# To add new ignore rules, obtain explicit user approval per CLAUDE.md
# project rules.

# Constrained allowlist for src/meson/tune-tables/:
# Static tune tables are checked in; the Wizard's host-tuned.ini is not.
src/meson/tune-tables/*
!src/meson/tune-tables/generic.ini
!src/meson/tune-tables/x86.ini
!src/meson/tune-tables/linux-s390x.ini
!src/meson/tune-tables/.gitkeep

# Python packaging artifacts (egg-info appears anywhere `pip install`
# runs; rarely useful in version control). Same approval as host-tuned.ini.
*.egg-info/
tools/build/
